# Brewfile.lord — server-scoped brew list for lord-ubuntu.
# Installed by ansible/lord-ubuntu.yml (uses ansible/installers/homebrew.yml
# with brewfile_path pointing here). Desktop uses Brewfile instead.
#
# NOTE: the dicklesworthstone/tap cass formula has no Linux URL block, so
# `brew bundle` fails on Ubuntu 26.04 — cass is installed by
# nix/modules/cass.nix's activation script instead (fetches the release
# tarball into ~/.local/bin/cass). Add brews here only after checking they
# ship a Linux bottle.

# (empty for now — kept so homebrew still runs, and as a placeholder for
# future server-side brews that do ship a Linux bottle.)
